  "details": "I'm sure this has been addressed, but since the most recent release there has been a severe drop in game function. Constant lag, and crashes, have been symptoms of a change most recently made in an update. I have well over 150 hours in VRChat, as well as a system that would never sweat with the game running max settings, or with a VR Headset. However, that's changed. I can't be in the Great Pug with more than 15 loaded avatars before my game hits around 15 FPS, and becomes unplayable. Blocking Avatars helps, but then the game itself becomes boring and lackluster. Hope this has nothing to do with the camera implementations, or custom avatar changes.",
